      "writtenOn": "2026-07-10T17:59:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So then what is the explanation for how this detects /ActualText and how it doesn\u0027t detect anything else? My reading of your reply is that none of the things I pointed to are relevant to /ActualText. Except I think maybe https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/pdfium/core/fpdftext/cpdf_textpage.cpp;l\u003d813;drc\u003d1e585df75166bfc8c28ca434e5afd6d5b1118345 still is relevant and you just said \"This writes into char_list_\" which is what you\u0027re checking here so I don\u0027t understand how that doesn\u0027t make your condition detect something other than /ActualText.\n\nIn fact I haven\u0027t seen a place where /ActualText ends up writing kPiece at all.",
      "parentUuid": "aa37589a_f0cf682b",
      "revId": "515aae3212b079283c30176d5ec7348ce9de79fb",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
