      "writtenOn": "2026-07-14T21:15:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The 3rd link in this conversation points to CPDF_TextPage::ProcessMarkedContent(), and that method is iterating over a variable called `actual_text`. That is the one to look at. As previously mention, `temp_char_list_` is never cross-contaminated, and this new code iterates over `temp_char_list_`.",
      "parentUuid": "64ca7776_442c8bbe",
      "revId": "515aae3212b079283c30176d5ec7348ce9de79fb",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
    },
