      "writtenOn": "2026-07-01T21:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe looking at the \"before\" code in https://pdfium-review.googlesource.com/c/pdfium/+/150190 can help explain what\u0027s going on. This is equivalent to the prior AddCharInfoByLRDirection() code.",
      "parentUuid": "8ef6c825_9a57907f",
